<title>DENMARK: A.P.MOELLER buys Korean tanker.</title>
<headline>A.P.MOELLER buys Korean tanker.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish shipping group A.P.Moeller said on Thursday that it had ordered a shuttle tanker of 126,000 tonnes deadweight from South Korea's Daewoo Heavy Industries.</p>
<p>It said that the vessel, for transporting crude oil from the drilling site for to the refinery, would be delivered in 1998. It gave no further details.</p>
<p>--Uffe Hansen, Copenhagen newsroom +45 33969658</p>
